   "headText": "主線 · 1990冬\n          先學做動作戲／先賺\n          何生事務所；兩份通告攤喺檯面，窗外可見",
   "line": "何生事務所嘅冷氣夠凍，檯面攤開兩份通告。",
   "speaker": "",
   "chars": [],
   "clippedTop": []
  },
  {
   "active": true,
   "kind": "system",
   "head": false,
   "headText": "",
   "line": "窗外走廊間中有人行過，帶住幾分呢行特有嘅急促。",
   "speaker": "",
   "chars": [],
   "clippedTop": []
  },
  {
   "active": true,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "head": false,
   "headText": "",
   "line": "阿偉，你入行第一單嘢，我幫你睇咗兩條路。",
   "speaker": "何生",
   "chars": [
    {
     "id": "ho_sang",
     "cls": "dlg106-char dlg106-right",
     "x": 197,
     "y": 254,
     "w": 177,
     "h": 487,
     "filter": "brightness(1)"
    }
   ],
   "clippedTop": []
  },
  {
   "active": true,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "head": false,
   "headText": "",
   "line": "一份係跟張子駿個班底學做動作戲，勝在穩陣，不過人工就真係慢熱。",
   "speaker": "何生",
   "chars": [
    {
     "id": "ho_sang",
     "cls": "dlg106-char dlg106-right",
     "x": 197,
     "y": 254,
     "w": 177,
     "h": 487,
     "filter": "brightness(1)"
    }
   ],
   "clippedTop": []
  },
  {
   "active": true,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "head": false,
   "headText": "",
   "line": "另一份係去電影片場做散工，錢就快，但人脈隨時散水。",
   "speaker": "何生",
   "chars": [
    {
     "id": "ho_sang",
     "cls": "dlg106-char dlg106-right",
     "x": 197,
     "y": 254,
     "w": 177,
     "h": 487,
     "filter": "brightness(1)"
    }
   ],
   "clippedTop": []
  },
  {
   "active": true,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "head": false,
   "headText": "",
   "line": "學動作戲聽落紮實啲，不過去片場做散工又可以快啲見錢。",
   "speaker": "阿偉",
   "chars": [
    {
     "id": "awi",
     "cls": "dlg106-char dlg106-left",
     "x": 16,
     "y": 254,
     "w": 167,
     "h": 487,
     "filter": "brightness(1)"
    },
    {
     "id": "ho_sang",
     "cls": "dlg106-char dlg106-right",
     "x": 197,
     "y": 254,
     "w": 177,
     "h": 487,
     "filter": "brightness(0.6)"
    }
   ],
   "clippedTop": []
  },
  {
   "active": true,
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "head": false,
   "headText": "",
   "line": "呢兩條路真係各有千秋，要諗清楚先好決定。",
   "speaker": "阿偉",
   "chars": [
